        "Content": "3 BED,   3 BATH,   SEMI-DETACHED,   93sqm,   GFCH,   UPVC  DG WINDOWS, SOUTH FACING BACK GARDEN\r\nNB: SEE VIRTUAL TOUR\r\n\r\nHogan Estates are delighted to present 73 Kiltipper Drive, Aylesbury, Dublin 24, a superbly maintained three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached residence extending to approximately 93 sq.m. (1,001 sq.ft.). Ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential development, this attractive family home offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation together with a sunny south-facing rear garden, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families and investors alike.\r\n\r\nInternally, the property is presented in excellent condition and benefits from spacious living accommodation, generously sized bedrooms and three bathrooms, providing comfort and convenience for modern family living. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, uPVC double-glazed windows, excellent storage and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nThe south-facing rear garden provides a wonderful private outdoor space, perfect for entertaining, family activities or simply enjoying sunshine throughout the day.\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n•\tSpacious 3-bedroom semi-detached family home\r\n•\tApprox. 93 sq.m. / 1,001 sq.ft.\r\n•\t3 bathrooms\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating\r\n•\tuPVC double-glazed windows\r\n•\tSouth-facing rear garden\r\n•\tBright and well-proportioned accommodation\r\n•\tOff-street parking\r\n•\tMature and family-friendly residential setting\r\n•\tExcellent transport connections and local amenities\r\n\r\nLocation\r\n73 Kiltipper Drive enjoys an enviable location in the heart of Aylesbury, one of Dublin 24's most established residential communities. Residents benefit from an outstanding range of local amenities, recreational facilities and transport options, all within easy reach.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEducational Facilities\r\nThe area is well served by a selection of respected primary and secondary schools including St. Martin de Porres National School, located in Aylesbury itself, together with Holy Rosary Primary School, St. Aidan's Community School, Firhouse Community College, Old Bawn Community School and Mount Seskin Community College. \r\nFor third-level education, Technological University Dublin (TU Dublin) Tallaght Campus is also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nSporting & Recreational Facilities\r\nAs the new owner of 73 Kiltipper Drive, you will be ideally positioned to enjoy a wealth of sporting and recreational amenities. Local clubs include Thomas Davis GAA Club, St Anne's GAA Club, Kilnamanagh AFC, Tallaght Town AFC, Tallaght Rugby Football Club and Tallaght Athletics Club. Football enthusiasts will appreciate the proximity of Tallaght Stadium, home of Shamrock Rovers FC. Leisure facilities are further enhanced by Tallaght Sports Complex, while the nearby Dodder Valley Park, Bohernabreena Reservoirs and the scenic Dublin Mountains provide outstanding opportunities for walking, cycling and outdoor recreation.\r\n\r\nResidents enjoy excellent shopping facilities including\r\nAylesbury Shopping Centre, serving the local community with everyday conveniences. turn1search8\r\nThe Square Tallaght, one of Dublin's largest shopping destinations, offering an extensive selection of retail stores, restaurants, cafés, leisure facilities and entertainment. \r\n\r\nCultural & Community Amenities\r\nThe property enjoys close proximity to the wider Tallaght area, home to a vibrant community atmosphere, cultural venues, cafés, restaurants and community facilities. The area's rich balance of urban convenience and access to the Dublin Mountains creates an exceptional lifestyle offering for residents. \r\n\r\nTransport Links\r\nCommuters are exceptionally well served by public transport and rod networks:\r\nDublin Bus Route 82 serves the Aylesbury/Kiltipper area and provides direct connections through Tallaght and onwards to Dublin City Centre. \r\nDublin Bus Route 77X provides peak-time commuter services connecting the area with UCD and the city. \r\nTallaght Luas Red Line Stop is within easy reach, providing frequent tram services to the City Centre, Heuston Station and the Docklands. turn1search2\r\nConvenient access to the N81, M50 motorway network, Citywest Business Campus ad major national routes. \r\n\r\nViewing Highly Recommended\r\nThis attractive home combines spacious accommodation, a sunny south-facing garden and a superb family-friendly location close to schools, shopping, sport and transport facilities, making it an excellent opportunity for discerning purchasers.\r\n\r\nEmail Hogan Estates TODAY to arrange your viewing of this exceptional family home."
      },
